      "text": "A particle moves along the curve \\( x^{3} + y^{3} = 9 \\) so that its coordinates \\( x \\) and \\( y \\) are differentiable functions of time \\( t \\). At the instant the particle is at the point \\( (1, 2) \\), \\( \\frac{dx}{dt} = 4 \\) units per second. Find \\( \\frac{dy}{dt} \\), in units per second, at that instant."
